{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"まず！\nわかつきお誕生日おめでとう！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/06/29/9815485/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/06/29/9815485/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/06/29/9815485/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/06/29/9815485/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/06/29/9815485/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/06/29/9815485/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/06/29/9815485/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/06/29/9815485/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/06/29/9815485/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/06/29/9815485/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/06/29/9815485/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/06/29/9815485/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/06/29/9815485/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/06/29/9815485/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/06/29/9815485/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わかつきじゃなくてかわいくわかにゃんおめでとうとメールしました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんも呼んでみてヽ(・∀・)ﾉ\n若様でもよし！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わかにゃんはいこまの趣味も理解してくれるし、イケメンだけどかわいくて頭いいしほんとイケメン！優しい！\n何事にも全力なわかにゃん。\nその姿勢がいつもみんなにいこまに力をくれます(｡・・｡)\nこれからもよろしくお願いしますヽ(・∀・)ﾉ\nいろいろ新しいこと始まってます！\n早くみて欲しいです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと乃木坂の二次元メンバーで進撃の巨人が今一番熱い！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よくなぁちゃんとれいかと調査兵団に入って立体起動装置を操作して巨人に食べられてやべえ時リヴァイ兵長に助けてもらいたいと語ってます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"実写映画化するしもしチャンスがあれば立体起動装置を操作したい！うぉおおお駆逐してやる！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ヽ(・∀・)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"漫画とかの話になるといこま熱くなりすぎて話し方変わるんだ〜笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じゃね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"へばなっ！"}],"source":"archive"}